Description: Cross-platform file management tool
 FileManager provides both CLI and web interface for file operations.
 .
 Features include:
 - File and folder operations (create, rename, delete, move, copy)
 - Batch operations for multiple files
 - Project template creation
 - Web-based interface for remote access
 - Cross-platform support (Linux, macOS, Windows, HarmonyOS)
